OL,3,ATwo teenagers seriously injured after
OL,4,Asword attack at Swedish school
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been seriously
OL,7,Finjured after a sword attack on a high
OL,8,Fschool in Sweden, authorities have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FPolice were called to the Brinell
OL,12,FSchool in Fagersta shortly after 14:00
OL,13,Flocal time (13:00 BST) on Friday, where
OL,14,Fofficers arrested one man.
OL,16,FA third person was wounded in the
OL,17,Fattack but the extent of their injuries
OL,18,Fhas not been confirmed, while reports
OL,19,Fin local media say the suspect was shot
OL,20,Fin the leg by police.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
