OL,3,ATwo teenagers seriously injured after
OL,4,Asword attack at Swedish school
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight other schools in the area were
OL,7,Fplaced under lockdown measures - which
OL,8,Fhave now been lifted - while a state of
OL,9,Fhigh alert was declared in the
OL,10,FVastmanland region following the
OL,11,Fattack.
